    "notes": "The period is classified as regressing because the back strength index fell from 101 to 96, a drop of 5 points, which clears the 3-point threshold for regression. This is the primary driver of the overall status. On the positive side, the chest index rose from 106 to 112, a gain of 6 points, which is excellent news given the goal of a 100 kg bench press. Triceps also improved from 105 to 108, a gain of 3 points, providing strong supporting progress for pressing strength. Shoulders held flat at 104, and biceps and legs both held flat at 100 and 102 respectively. The back regression is the only concern, but it is a significant one and should be actively addressed next period.",
